  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960221,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16 Sprite Scroller: A - A Commodore 64 Classic\n\nPrepare for a frantic and visually stunning arcade experience with *16 Sprite Scroller: A* for the Commodore 64! This fast-paced action game throws you into a chaotic world of bouncing, colliding sprites as you navigate a series of increasingly challenging levels. \n\nYou control a lone character, desperately trying to survive the onslaught of 16 different sprite types, each with unique movement patterns and behaviors. The gameplay is a relentless test of reflexes and spatial awareness.  Dodging, weaving, and strategically utilizing the environment are key to survival. \n\n*16 Sprite Scroller: A* boasts impressive technical achievements for the C64, showcasing a remarkable density of on-screen sprites – a true spectacle for the time.  The game's vibrant graphics and energetic soundtrack create an immersive and addictive experience.  Simple in concept, yet incredibly difficult to master, *16 Sprite Scroller: A* remains a beloved and iconic title in the Commodore 64 library. Can you survive the sprite swarm?"
    },
